    "title": "St. Robert man charged with trafficking fentanyl pleads guilty to reduced charge - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Leslie Taylor ,\n1 days ago A Pulaski County man arrested last year following a drug raid on his home is sentenced to prison. It was last October when the Pulaski County Sheriff’s Office Special Reaction Team executed a narcotics search warrant in the 100 block of Cathy Lane in St. Robert. During the raid, officers found fentanyl-loaded syringes, suspected purple fentanyl, and drug paraphernalia. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
